 <!-- The ONE place the app's fonts are named (code reads them through DeckFonts).
      Inter (SIL OFL 1.1, bundled with its licence in Assets/Fonts) for all UI and chat
      text on Windows 10 and 11 alike, so both PCs match each other and the Mac.
      Cascadia Mono (OFL, bundled: Windows 10 and plain Windows 11 lack it) for code.
      Windows 10 has no Segoe Fluent Icons; Segoe MDL2 Assets carries the same glyphs. -->
 <FontFamily x:Key="DeckTextFontFamily">ms-appx:///Assets/Fonts/Inter.ttc#Inter, Segoe UI Variable Text, Segoe UI</FontFamily>
 <FontFamily x:Key="DeckMonoFontFamily">ms-appx:///Assets/Fonts/CascadiaMono.ttc#Cascadia Mono, Consolas</FontFamily>
 <FontFamily x:Key="DeckIconFontFamily">Segoe Fluent Icons, Segoe MDL2 Assets</FontFamily>
